    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Project DINOZ</strong>, you step into the boots of a recon specialist sent to investigate a communications blackout at a remote research facility. What begins as a routine mission quickly turns into a nightmare as you and your team uncover the true horror lurking in the shadows: dinosaurs\u2014real, intelligent, and hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, mysterious island filled with abandoned labs, decaying outposts, and dense wilderness that hides secrets beneath the surface. Unlock new regions as you survive, from towering mountains to shadowed valleys and underground tunnels that echo with distant roars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival won\u2019t be easy. You\u2019re alone. Cut off from the world. The predators here are relentless, and every encounter could be your last. Use stealth, strategy, and limited resources to avoid detection. Remember\u2014you\u2019re no hunter here. You're the hunted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd96 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Story Mode</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a narrative-driven survival horror experience where your only goal is to uncover the truth\u2014and make it out alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Predator AI</strong><br>Face off against highly intelligent and coordinated dinosaurs that stalk, flank, and adapt to your behavior. Every encounter is unpredictable and deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Island with Underground Facilities</strong><br>Explore over 80 square kilometers of surface terrain and just as much hidden underground, from jungle ravines and research zones to multi-level labs deep beneath the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles &amp; Tools</strong><br>Locate and operate dirt bikes, ATVs, and other utility vehicles\u2014but use them wisely. Sound draws predators, and fuel is limited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gameplay &amp; Stealth</strong><br>Resources are scarce. Use light, noise, and terrain to your advantage. Avoid combat wherever possible\u2014most predators can\u2019t be taken down through force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability &amp; Discovery</strong><br>Uncover hidden lore, secret outposts, and branching narrative outcomes. Optional objectives and exploration unlock new paths and endings, rewarding curiosity and risk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651830/extras/b9e1cbeb418d1f946e42caa7f58ab116.avif?t=1748730394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Project DINOZ</strong>, you step into the boots of a recon specialist sent to investigate a communications blackout at a remote research facility. What begins as a routine mission quickly turns into a nightmare as you and your team uncover the true horror lurking in the shadows: dinosaurs\u2014real, intelligent, and hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, mysterious island filled with abandoned labs, decaying outposts, and dense wilderness that hides secrets beneath the surface. Unlock new regions as you survive, from towering mountains to shadowed valleys and underground tunnels that echo with distant roars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival won\u2019t be easy. You\u2019re alone. Cut off from the world. The predators here are relentless, and every encounter could be your last. Use stealth, strategy, and limited resources to avoid detection. Remember\u2014you\u2019re no hunter here. You're the hunted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd96 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Story Mode</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a narrative-driven survival horror experience where your only goal is to uncover the truth\u2014and make it out alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Predator AI</strong><br>Face off against highly intelligent and coordinated dinosaurs that stalk, flank, and adapt to your behavior. Every encounter is unpredictable and deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Island with Underground Facilities</strong><br>Explore over 80 square kilometers of surface terrain and just as much hidden underground, from jungle ravines and research zones to multi-level labs deep beneath the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles &amp; Tools</strong><br>Locate and operate dirt bikes, ATVs, and other utility vehicles\u2014but use them wisely. Sound draws predators, and fuel is limited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gameplay &amp; Stealth</strong><br>Resources are scarce. Use light, noise, and terrain to your advantage. Avoid combat wherever possible\u2014most predators can\u2019t be taken down through force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability &amp; Discovery</strong><br>Uncover hidden lore, secret outposts, and branching narrative outcomes. Optional objectives and exploration unlock new paths and endings, rewarding curiosity and risk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651830/extras/b9e1cbeb418d1f946e42caa7f58ab116.avif?t=1748730394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
